{"created": "2021-06-07T21:57:26.082713+00:00", "modified": "2026-04-23T02:08:11.477034+00:00", "id": 4904800, "conceptrecid": "4904799", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4904800", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.4904799", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4904800", "metadata": {"title": "HumBugDB: a large-scale acoustic mosquito dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4904800", "publication_date": "2021-06-07", "description": "<p><strong>A large-scale multi-species dataset of acoustic recordings</strong></p>\n\n<p>Dataset accompanying code and paper: <em>HumBugDB: a large-scale acoustic mosquito dataset</em>.</p>\n\n<p>A large-scale multi-species dataset containing recordings of mosquitoes collected from multiple locations globally, as well as via different collection methods.&nbsp;In total, we present 71,286 seconds (20 hours) of labelled mosquito data with 53,227 seconds (15 hours) of corresponding background noise, recorded at the sites of 8 experiments.&nbsp;&nbsp;Of these, 64,843 seconds contain species metadata, consisting of 36 species (or species complexes).</p>\n\n<p>This repository contains:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Multi-part zip of audio files to be extracted into the same folder</li>\n\t<li>Metadata in csv format:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/5812d858-9cb8-45cf-af03-9f96f44a8313/neurips_2021_zenodo_0_0_1.csv?versionId=a062556f-30da-4c2a-a414-b24bdb67cbf9\">neurips_2021_zenodo_0_0_1.csv</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This data is supplemented by a GitHub repository,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB\">https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB</a>, which aids as follows:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The multi-part zip&nbsp;is intended to be extracted into the folder:<em> /data/audio/</em> in the repository.</li>\n\t<li>Latest metadata is hosted on <a href=\"https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB/tree/master/data/metadata\">GitHub</a> to allow the modification of additional metadata as it becomes available in the database or bug-fixing.</li>\n\t<li>Documentation for code use, and a complete Datasheet for Datasets also available on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB/blob/master/docs/NeurIPS_2021_HumBugDB_Supplement.pdf\">GitHub</a>.</li>\n\t<li>Example code for data splitting,&nbsp;feature extraction, model training, and evaluation in the top-level notebook&nbsp;<em>main.ipynb</em>.</li>\n\t<li>Bayesian Convolutional Neural Network models, in both Keras and PyTorch,&nbsp;trained on this data available at <a href=\"https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB/releases/tag/v1.0\">GitHub release v1.0</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ivan Kiskin", "affiliation": "University of Oxford", "orcid": "0000-0002-2551-840X"}, {"name": "Lawrence Wang", "affiliation": "University of Oxford"}, {"name": "Marianne Sinka", "affiliation": "University of Oxford", "orcid": "0000-0001-7145-3179"}, {"name": "Adam D. Cobb", "affiliation": "SRI International", "orcid": "0000-0003-2868-6983"}, {"name": "Benjamin Gutteridge", "affiliation": "University of Oxford"}, {"name": "Davide Zilli", "affiliation": "Mind Foundry Ltd."}, {"name": "Waqas Rafique", "affiliation": "University of Oxford"}, {"name": "Rinita Dam", "affiliation": "University of Oxford"}, {"name": "Theodoros Marinos", "affiliation": "University of Surrey"}, {"name": "Yunpeng Li", "affiliation": "University of Surrey", "orcid": "0000-0003-4798-541X"}, {"name": "Gerard Killeen", "affiliation": "UCC BEES"}, {"name": "Dickson Msaky", "affiliation": "IHI Tanzania"}, {"name": "Emmanuel Kaindoa", "affiliation": "IHI Tanzania"}, {"name": "Kathy Willis", "affiliation": "University of Oxford", "orcid": "0000-0002-6763-2489"}, {"name": "Steve J. Roberts", "affiliation": "University of Oxford", "orcid": "0000-0002-9305-9268"}], "keywords": ["Acoustic mosquito recordings", "Bayesian neural networks", "Audio event detection", "Species recognition"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/HumBug-Mosquito/HumBugDB", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "arXiv:1705.05180", "relation": "hasPart", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "arxiv"}, {"identifier": "10.1007/s00521-018-3626-7", "relation": "hasPart", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "arXiv:1711.06346", "relation": "hasPart", "resource_type": "publication-conferencepaper", "scheme": "arxiv"}, {"identifier": "arXiv:1712.02488", "relation": "hasPart", "resource_type": "publication-conferencepaper", "scheme": "arxiv"}, {"identifier": "10.1109/ICASSP40776.2020.9053141", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "publication-conferencepaper", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://humbug.ox.ac.uk/article/poster", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "poster", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://humbug.ox.ac.uk/", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "publication-deliverable", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~parg/pubs/theses/IvanPhDThesisFinal.pdf", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "publication-dissertation", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "0.0.1", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "ai_ml"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "4904799"}}]}, "notes": "Funding from the 2014 Google Impact Challenge Award, and The Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation (https://www.gatesfoundation.org/about/committed-grants/2019/07/opp1209888)"}, "title": "HumBugDB: a large-scale acoustic mosquito dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4904800", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4904800", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4904800?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4904800", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4904800", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.o